 "Сколькими способами можно заполнить доску? Объясни, как ты их сосчитал.": "<figure class='st'><svg viewBox='0 0 440 128' width='100%' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' font-family='ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,sans-serif' role='img' aria-label='Рисунок условия: полоска из трёх пустых клеток и числа от 1 до 17'><rect x='146' y='10' width='48' height='48' rx='4' fill='none' stroke='var(--ink)' stroke-width='2'/><text x='170' y='76' fill='var(--muted)' font-size='13' text-anchor='middle'>a₁</text><rect x='198' y='10' width='48' height='48' rx='4' fill='none' stroke='var(--ink)' stroke-width='2'/><text x='222' y='76' fill='var(--muted)' font-size='13' text-anchor='middle'>a₂</text><rect x='250' y='10' width='48' height='48' rx='4' fill='none' stroke='var(--ink)' stroke-width='2'/><text x='274' y='76' fill='var(--muted)' font-size='13' text-anchor='middle'>a₃</text><rect x='12.0' y='92' width='22' height='24' rx='3' fill='none' stroke='var(--line)' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='23.0' y='109' fill='var(--muted)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle'>1</text><rect x='36.8' y='92' width='22' height='24' rx='3' fill='none' stroke='var(--line)' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='47.8' y='109' fill='var(--muted)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle'>2</text><rect x='61.6' y='92' width='22' height='24' rx='3' fill='none' stroke='var(--line)' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='72.6' y='109' fill='var(--muted)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle'>3</text><rect x='86.4' y='92' width='22' height='24' rx='3' fill='none' stroke='var(--line)' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='97.4' y='109' fill='var(--muted)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle'>4</text><rect x='111.2' y='92' width='22' height='24' rx='3' fill='none' stroke='var(--line)' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='122.2' y='109' fill='var(--muted)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle'>5</text><rect x='136.0' y='92' width='22' height='24' rx='3' fill='none' stroke='var(--line)' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='147.0' y='109' fill='var(--muted)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle'>6</text><rect x='160.8' y='92' width='22' height='24' rx='3' fill='none' stroke='var(--line)' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='171.8' y='109' fill='var(--muted)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle'>7</text><rect x='185.6' y='92' width='22' height='24' rx='3' fill='none' stroke='var(--line)' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='196.6' y='109' fill='var(--muted)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle'>8</text><rect x='210.4' y='92' width='22' height='24' rx='3' fill='none' stroke='var(--line)' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='221.4' y='109' fill='var(--muted)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle'>9</text><rect x='235.2' y='92' width='22' height='24' rx='3' fill='none' stroke='var(--line)' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='246.2' y='109' fill='var(--muted)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle'>10</text><rect x='260.0' y='92' width='22' height='24' rx='3' fill='none' stroke='var(--line)' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='271.0' y='109' fill='var(--muted)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle'>11</text><rect x='284.8' y='92' width='22' height='24' rx='3' fill='none' stroke='var(--line)' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='295.8' y='109' fill='var(--muted)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle'>12</text><rect x='309.6' y='92' width='22' height='24' rx='3' fill='none' stroke='var(--line)' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='320.6' y='109' fill='var(--muted)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle'>13</text><rect x='334.4' y='92' width='22' height='24' rx='3' fill='none' stroke='var(--line)' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='345.4' y='109' fill='var(--muted)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle'>14</text><rect x='359.2' y='92' width='22' height='24' rx='3' fill='none' stroke='var(--line)' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='370.2' y='109' fill='var(--muted)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle'>15</text><rect x='384.0' y='92' width='22' height='24' rx='3' fill='none' stroke='var(--line)' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='395.0' y='109' fill='var(--muted)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle'>16</text><rect x='408.8' y='92' width='22' height='24' rx='3' fill='none' stroke='var(--line)' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='419.8' y='109' fill='var(--muted)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle'>17</text></svg><figcaption>Рисунок условия: полоска из трёх клеток (имена a₁, a₂, a₃ добавлены для разбора) и числа, из которых выбирают три. Соседние клетки — a₁ с a₂ и a₂ с a₃; крайние друг друга не касаются.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Проверяю формулы на одном мире руками": "<figure class='st'><svg viewBox='0 0 440 120' width='100%' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' font-family='ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,sans-serif' role='img' aria-label='Мир a₂ = 9: слева годятся 1–7, справа 11–17, 8 и 10 запрещены'><rect x='12.0' y='30' width='22' height='26' rx='3' fill='var(--blue)' fill-opacity='.2' stroke='var(--blue)' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='23.0' y='48' fill='var(--ink)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>1</text><rect x='36.8' y='30' width='22' height='26' rx='3' fill='var(--blue)' fill-opacity='.2' stroke='var(--blue)' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='47.8' y='48' fill='var(--ink)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>2</text><rect x='61.6' y='30' width='22' height='26' rx='3' fill='var(--blue)' fill-opacity='.2' stroke='var(--blue)' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='72.6' y='48' fill='var(--ink)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>3</text><rect x='86.4' y='30' width='22' height='26' rx='3' fill='var(--blue)' fill-opacity='.2' stroke='var(--blue)' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='97.4' y='48' fill='var(--ink)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>4</text><rect x='111.2' y='30' width='22' height='26' rx='3' fill='var(--blue)' fill-opacity='.2' stroke='var(--blue)' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='122.2' y='48' fill='var(--ink)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>5</text><rect x='136.0' y='30' width='22' height='26' rx='3' fill='var(--blue)' fill-opacity='.2' stroke='var(--blue)' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='147.0' y='48' fill='var(--ink)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>6</text><rect x='160.8' y='30' width='22' height='26' rx='3' fill='var(--blue)' fill-opacity='.2' stroke='var(--blue)' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='171.8' y='48' fill='var(--ink)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>7</text><rect x='185.6' y='30' width='22' height='26' rx='3' fill='var(--red)' fill-opacity='.18' stroke='var(--red)' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='196.6' y='48' fill='var(--red)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>8</text><path d='M188.6 33L204.6 53M204.6 33L188.6 53' stroke='var(--red)' stroke-width='1.6'/><rect x='210.4' y='30' width='22' height='26' rx='3' fill='var(--gold)' fill-opacity='.25' stroke='var(--gold)' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='221.4' y='48' fill='var(--gold)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>9</text><rect x='235.2' y='30' width='22' height='26' rx='3' fill='var(--red)' fill-opacity='.18' stroke='var(--red)' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='246.2' y='48' fill='var(--red)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>10</text><path d='M238.2 33L254.2 53M254.2 33L238.2 53' stroke='var(--red)' stroke-width='1.6'/><rect x='260.0' y='30' width='22' height='26' rx='3' fill='var(--blue)' fill-opacity='.2' stroke='var(--blue)' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='271.0' y='48' fill='var(--ink)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>11</text><rect x='284.8' y='30' width='22' height='26' rx='3' fill='var(--blue)' fill-opacity='.2' stroke='var(--blue)' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='295.8' y='48' fill='var(--ink)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>12</text><rect x='309.6' y='30' width='22' height='26' rx='3' fill='var(--blue)' fill-opacity='.2' stroke='var(--blue)' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='320.6' y='48' fill='var(--ink)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>13</text><rect x='334.4' y='30' width='22' height='26' rx='3' fill='var(--blue)' fill-opacity='.2' stroke='var(--blue)' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='345.4' y='48' fill='var(--ink)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>14</text><rect x='359.2' y='30' width='22' height='26' rx='3' fill='var(--blue)' fill-opacity='.2' stroke='var(--blue)' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='370.2' y='48' fill='var(--ink)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>15</text><rect x='384.0' y='30' width='22' height='26' rx='3' fill='var(--blue)' fill-opacity='.2' stroke='var(--blue)' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='395.0' y='48' fill='var(--ink)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>16</text><rect x='408.8' y='30' width='22' height='26' rx='3' fill='var(--blue)' fill-opacity='.2' stroke='var(--blue)' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='419.8' y='48' fill='var(--ink)' font-size='12' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>17</text><text x='221.4' y='20' fill='var(--gold)' font-size='13' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>a₂ = 9</text><path d='M12.0 64V70H182.8V64' fill='none' stroke='var(--blue)' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='97.4' y='88' fill='var(--muted)' font-size='13' text-anchor='middle'>a₁: 7 вариантов</text><path d='M260.0 64V70H430.8V64' fill='none' stroke='var(--blue)' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='345.4' y='88' fill='var(--muted)' font-size='13' text-anchor='middle'>a₃: 7 вариантов</text><text x='220' y='112' fill='var(--green)' font-size='14' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>7 · 7 = 49 заполнений</text></svg><figcaption>Мир a₂ = 9. Красные 8 и 10 стоят вплотную к среднему — туда нельзя. Левый и правый наборы разделены средним числом и друг друга не касаются: какое бы число ни взяли слева, справа остаются все семь. Поэтому варианты перемножаются.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Оба ряда непусты при a₂ от 3 до 15": "<figure class=\"st\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 620 100\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"30\" y=\"30\" width=\"30\" height=\"32\" fill=\"#12281c\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" /><text x=\"45.0\" y=\"51\" fill=\"#5fd38d\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><rect x=\"64\" y=\"30\" width=\"30\" height=\"32\" fill=\"#12281c\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" /><text x=\"79.0\" y=\"51\" fill=\"#5fd38d\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><rect x=\"98\" y=\"30\" width=\"30\" height=\"32\" fill=\"#12281c\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" /><text x=\"113.0\" y=\"51\" fill=\"#5fd38d\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><rect x=\"132\" y=\"30\" width=\"30\" height=\"32\" fill=\"#12281c\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" /><text x=\"147.0\" y=\"51\" fill=\"#5fd38d\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><rect x=\"166\" y=\"30\" width=\"30\" height=\"32\" fill=\"#12281c\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" /><text x=\"181.0\" y=\"51\" fill=\"#5fd38d\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"30\" width=\"30\" height=\"32\" fill=\"#12281c\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" /><text x=\"215.0\" y=\"51\" fill=\"#5fd38d\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text><rect x=\"234\" y=\"30\" width=\"30\" height=\"32\" fill=\"#12281c\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" /><text x=\"249.0\" y=\"51\" fill=\"#5fd38d\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">7</text><rect x=\"268\" y=\"30\" width=\"30\" height=\"32\" fill=\"#2a1416\" stroke=\"#f2686c\" /><text x=\"283.0\" y=\"51\" fill=\"#f2686c\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">8</text><rect x=\"302\" y=\"30\" width=\"30\" height=\"32\" fill=\"#2a2110\" stroke=\"#f0a83c\" /><text x=\"317.0\" y=\"51\" fill=\"#f0a83c\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">9</text><rect x=\"336\" y=\"30\" width=\"30\" height=\"32\" fill=\"#2a1416\" stroke=\"#f2686c\" /><text x=\"351.0\" y=\"51\" fill=\"#f2686c\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10</text><rect x=\"370\" y=\"30\" width=\"30\" height=\"32\" fill=\"#12281c\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" /><text x=\"385.0\" y=\"51\" fill=\"#5fd38d\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">11</text><rect x=\"404\" y=\"30\" width=\"30\" height=\"32\" fill=\"#12281c\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" /><text x=\"419.0\" y=\"51\" fill=\"#5fd38d\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">12</text><rect x=\"438\" y=\"30\" width=\"30\" height=\"32\" fill=\"#12281c\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" /><text x=\"453.0\" y=\"51\" fill=\"#5fd38d\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">13</text><rect x=\"472\" y=\"30\" width=\"30\" height=\"32\" fill=\"#12281c\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" /><text x=\"487.0\" y=\"51\" fill=\"#5fd38d\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">14</text><rect x=\"506\" y=\"30\" width=\"30\" height=\"32\" fill=\"#12281c\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" /><text x=\"521.0\" y=\"51\" fill=\"#5fd38d\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">15</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"30\" width=\"30\" height=\"32\" fill=\"#12281c\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" /><text x=\"555.0\" y=\"51\" fill=\"#5fd38d\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">16</text><rect x=\"574\" y=\"30\" width=\"30\" height=\"32\" fill=\"#12281c\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" /><text x=\"589.0\" y=\"51\" fill=\"#5fd38d\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">17</text><text x=\"147\" y=\"86\" fill=\"#5fd38d\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">a₁: 7 вариантов</text><text x=\"317\" y=\"86\" fill=\"#f0a83c\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">a₂ = 9</text><text x=\"487\" y=\"86\" fill=\"#5fd38d\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">a₃: 7 вариантов</text><text x=\"317\" y=\"20\" fill=\"#f2686c\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">вплотную нельзя</text></svg><figcaption>Мир a₂ = 9. <b style=\"color:#f2686c\">8 и 10</b> стоят вплотную к среднему и запрещены; слева годятся <b style=\"color:#5fd38d\">1–7</b>, справа <b style=\"color:#5fd38d\">11–17</b>. Крайние клетки не соседи, поэтому любое левое сочетается с любым правым: 7 · 7 = 49.</figcaption></figure>",
