nchor=\"middle\">40</text><rect x=\"216\" y=\"22\" width=\"44\" height=\"34\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#243040\" /><rect x=\"216\" y=\"60\" width=\"44\" height=\"34\" fill=\"#12281c\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" /><text x=\"238.0\" y=\"44\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\">7</text><text x=\"238.0\" y=\"82\" fill=\"#5fd38d\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">45</text><rect x=\"260\" y=\"22\" width=\"44\" height=\"34\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#243040\" /><rect x=\"260\" y=\"60\" width=\"44\" height=\"34\" fill=\"#12281c\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" /><text x=\"282.0\" y=\"44\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\">8</text><text x=\"282.0\" y=\"82\" fill=\"#5fd38d\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">48</text><rect x=\"304\" y=\"22\" width=\"44\" height=\"34\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#243040\" /><rect x=\"304\" y=\"60\" width=\"44\" height=\"34\" fill=\"#2a2110\" stroke=\"#f0a83c\" /><text x=\"326.0\" y=\"44\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\">9</text><text x=\"326.0\" y=\"82\" fill=\"#f0a83c\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">49</text><rect x=\"348\" y=\"22\" width=\"44\" height=\"34\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#243040\" /><rect x=\"348\" y=\"60\" width=\"44\" height=\"34\" fill=\"#12281c\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" /><text x=\"370.0\" y=\"44\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10</text><text x=\"370.0\" y=\"82\" fill=\"#5fd38d\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">48</text><rect x=\"392\" y=\"22\" width=\"44\" height=\"34\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#243040\" /><rect x=\"392\" y=\"60\" width=\"44\" height=\"34\" fill=\"#12281c\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" /><text x=\"414.0\" y=\"44\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\">11</text><text x=\"414.0\" y=\"82\" fill=\"#5fd38d\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">45</text><rect x=\"436\" y=\"22\" width=\"44\" height=\"34\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#243040\" /><rect x=\"436\" y=\"60\" width=\"44\" height=\"34\" fill=\"#12281c\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" /><text x=\"458.0\" y=\"44\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\">12</text><text x=\"458.0\" y=\"82\" fill=\"#5fd38d\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">40</text><rect x=\"480\" y=\"22\" width=\"44\" height=\"34\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#243040\" /><rect x=\"480\" y=\"60\" width=\"44\" height=\"34\" fill=\"#12281c\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" /><text x=\"502.0\" y=\"44\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\">13</text><text x=\"502.0\" y=\"82\" fill=\"#5fd38d\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">33</text><rect x=\"524\" y=\"22\" width=\"44\" height=\"34\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#243040\" /><rect x=\"524\" y=\"60\" width=\"44\" height=\"34\" fill=\"#12281c\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" /><text x=\"546.0\" y=\"44\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\">14</text><text x=\"546.0\" y=\"82\" fill=\"#5fd38d\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">24</text><rect x=\"568\" y=\"22\" width=\"44\" height=\"34\" fill=\"#131923\" stroke=\"#243040\" /><rect x=\"568\" y=\"60\" width=\"44\" height=\"34\" fill=\"#12281c\" stroke=\"#5fd38d\" /><text x=\"590.0\" y=\"44\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\">15</text><text x=\"590.0\" y=\"82\" fill=\"#5fd38d\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">13</text><text x=\"326.0\" y=\"122\" fill=\"#e8eef6\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2 · 203 + 49 = 455</text></svg><figcaption>Тринадцать миров. Числа читаются одинаково слева и справа: у мира a₂ = 3 множители 1 и 13, у мира a₂ = 15 — 13 и 1. Без пары только <b style=\"color:#f0a83c\">средний мир 49</b>.</figcaption></figure>"
